<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Chengdu on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/chengdu/</link><description>Recent content in Chengdu on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 22:54:35 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/chengdu/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>国庆游记</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 21:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post 国庆游记" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="国庆游记"&gt;国庆游记&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;2025年国庆成都及上海旅游记录&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="准备"&gt;准备&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="小红书" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="135px" data-flex-grow="56" height="2133" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_xhs.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_xhs_hu_75a757c8cd7bd515.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_xhs.webp 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;9月30号晚上还没任何计划&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;10月1号晚上蹲到便宜机票直接决定出发&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="行程" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="112px" data-flex-grow="46" height="2560" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_ticket.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_ticket_hu_1a73dfa6ca9abbbd.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/ss_ticket.webp 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月3日"&gt;10月3日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;成功赶早班地铁去机场起飞&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="云海" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942_hu_4d4aa8a7a8a39323.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942_hu_7cab91246e735be7.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942_hu_f500625cad9b3c3d.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_080942.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到成都已经是晚上了，到酒店办完入住去春熙路&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="熊猫屁股" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647_hu_4d4fd590131a52ce.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647_hu_664095e7fdaca93b.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647_hu_5185f49170efec41.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_192647.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="积木熊猫" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202_hu_69599beda830276d.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202_hu_ee01a4ccf6141410.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202_hu_fc42e09bdae81da8.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_213202.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="嘟嘟哒嘟嘟哒" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226_hu_6957242c4121b030.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226_hu_659be5d4215f2e0.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226_hu_8ecd105462ab0c45.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251003_220226.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月4日"&gt;10月4日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;早上先去宽窄巷子，人特别多，没太多特别的&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="宽窄巷子" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429_hu_2a66cf955547ddfe.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429_hu_456f2c330f699f81.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429_hu_ca2a7cc90857c357.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_111429.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下午换完酒店后比较晚了，没赶上去熊猫基地，下次再来&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在杜甫草堂和武侯祠之间选了后者&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="武侯祠" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721_hu_9ca752a55cc545e2.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721_hu_39f3f3cc6b305c47.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721_hu_877419f3d920f92d.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251004_165721.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;晚上去了锦里，感觉还是没什么特别的，就没拍照&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月5日"&gt;10月5日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;今天报了一日旅游团去青城山和都江堰&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="青城山" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2303" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411_hu_cac94f9d3777ab0d.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411_hu_35f39b9231b42335.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411_hu_18e59e86030b3cc1.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_084411.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="都江堰" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3060" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226_hu_d2737e90e09bf36b.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226_hu_fde3c10c81582f4b.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226_hu_745f14594a5512ea.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_152226.webp 4080w" width="4080"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="自拍熊猫" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954_hu_d509189e2e657949.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954_hu_6a70966e5c612a15.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954_hu_da77783e0118ab18.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251005_192954.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月6日"&gt;10月6日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;又到上海，找了在上海中转一天的机票&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到达已经是下午了，随便逛逛&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="四行仓库" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3072" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132_hu_2c1dfab811624bff.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132_hu_6d628181a2e8d75.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132_hu_cc3ddd75fe823566.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_164132.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到四行仓库已经闭馆了，只拍了个外景&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="地道" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2303" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158_hu_523e07803a8be99f.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158_hu_2afac4511ec9bcb6.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158_hu_872b164f5b2356a3.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_174158.webp 4096w" width="4096"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;广东　路人　行地道&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;地道地地道道地道地地道&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="静安寺" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3060" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646_hu_5ba2125eda73dfb7.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646_hu_62449b56686e6d6f.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646_hu_88abc5290b4a1081.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_190646.webp 4080w" width="4080"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="冲塔" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655_hu_5ee909df8bb10b1c.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655_hu_6a2b12b0c5b81ff9.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655_hu_7f9a93e7efcc83cd.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251006_220655.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="10月7日"&gt;10月7日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;订了一家地铁旁边的酒店&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="video-wrapper"&gt;&#10; &lt;video&#10; controls&#10; src="vid/VID_20251007_081238.mp4"&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&#10; Your browser doesn't support HTML5 video. Here is a&#10; &lt;a href="vid/VID_20251007_081238.mp4"&gt;link to the video&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/video&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="video-caption"&gt;地铁&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;返程，飞机在中午&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;早上没地方去，原计划去上海动物园，后来觉得时间太紧&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;搜了下周边有个商业街叫蟠龙天地，非古镇纯仿古，就过去转了半个多小时&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4096" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825_hu_51fd95b2a23715d3.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825_hu_ef14445b03247425.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825_hu_30efa3dd849c088f.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/251228-oct-travel/img/IMG_20251007_091825.webp 3072w" width="3072"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="video-wrapper"&gt;&#10; &lt;video&#10; controls&#10; src="vid/VID_20251007_105548.mp4"&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&#10; Your browser doesn't support HTML5 video. Here is a&#10; &lt;a href="vid/VID_20251007_105548.mp4"&gt;link to the video&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/video&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="video-caption"&gt;起飞&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;总结：依然是独自旅行，国庆节有出去一下至少感觉不是虚度&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;消费统计：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;table&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;thead&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;项目&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;金额&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;占比&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/thead&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;tbody&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;交通&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;32.70&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;1.22%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;报团&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;410.00&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;15.34%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;购物&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;123.00&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;4.60%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;路费&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;916.50&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;34.30%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;酒店&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;381.50&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;14.28%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;门票&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;50.00&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;1.87%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;饮食&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;141.25&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;5.29%&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;总计&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;2672.10&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/tbody&gt;&#10;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>